  "answer": "Not ready: the sandboxes and the Azure subscriptions are there, but none of the free sandboxes can launch the Corvane Hardened Netwarden AMI.\n\n**AWS sandboxes, reservation tessellate-2611.** Four are free, exactly one per seat:\n\n| sandbox | account | active Corvane Hardened Netwarden agreement? |\n|---|---|---|\n| sandbox8521 | 731406295817 | no (its only agreement is Quillstone Logweave) |\n| sandbox8522 | 731406295906 | no |\n| sandbox8523 | 846250173394 | no: agmt-5ty4b8gk6pzr was a free trial and is EXPIRED (ended 2026-10-09) |\n| sandbox8524 | 846250173467 | no |\n\nsandbox8525 and sandbox8526 are in use by rvashisht (the dry-run seats).\n\n**Azure pool 44 (pools database):** 6 of its 8 subscriptions are free (pool-44-103 to pool-44-108), which covers 4 seats.\n\n**Corvane Hardened Netwarden agreements.** The active ones are on sandbox8525 (592718360245), sandbox8526 (592718360372) and golden-images-shared (905613287440). None of them is on a free sandbox. The only Corvane agreement on a free sandbox, sandbox8523's, has expired.\n\nSo 0 of the 4 seats can boot the lab as things stand. Before 2026-11-04, accept the Corvane Hardened Netwarden offer in sandbox8521 to sandbox8524 (or renew it in sandbox8523).\n"
